[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894271488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-3894271488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":3894271488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oHd4A","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T01:13:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T01:13:57Z","body":"Seems like it might be caused by re-spirv which does increase the shader compilation time of cached shaders by a little bit (although 5x is much more than any of us observed during testing). \n\nTo clarify, are you loading a voxelGI node at runtime?\n\nThis sounds like a case where the ubershader doesn't have knowledge of the voxelGI node until runtime and thus has to recompile all shaders once the voxelGI node is loaded","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894271488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894331496","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-3894331496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":3894331496,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oHsho","user":{"login":"rei-00","id":66915875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2OTE1ODc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66915875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00","html_url":"https://github.com/rei-00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rei-00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T01:35:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T01:35:14Z","body":"I'm not sure what qualifies as runtime exactly... My technical knowledge on this is pretty limited still. \n\nWhat I have is the VoxelGI enabled and visible in the editor before starting. Then on _ready() I hide() the VoxelGI node and show() it later. This used to not cause visible stutters in my project.\n\nOne fix I found that does not cause stutters is if instead of using hide() in _ready() I put voxelgi.data.energy = 0. Then when I want to show it I just set the energy value to what I need. This causes no stutter at all.\n\nI hope this is helpful.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894331496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3895152567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-3895152567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":3895152567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oK0-3","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T06:26:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T06:26:30Z","body":"That is very helpful. Thank you. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3895152567/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4352141394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-4352141394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":4352141394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA2hoUg","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T11:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T11:40:26Z","body":"This might be salvageable by dumping the result of respv::Shader to the shader container binary, but I don't think loading VoxelGI mid frame is something you want to do either way. Doing that enables the advanced shader group, which causes either shader compilations to kick in, or file lookups to happen in the disk. It may be stutter free on old versions on your PC, but might not on potentially weaker systems.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4352141394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353889335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-4353889335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":4353889335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA4MUNw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:39:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T15:39:26Z","body":"> Doing that enables the advanced shader group, which causes either shader compilations to kick in, or file lookups to happen in the disk. It may be stutter free on old versions on your PC, but might not on potentially weaker systems.\n\nThey say the VoxelGI node is in the scene tree at load time, so the advanced shader group should be enabled at load time and shouldn't create a stutter when unhidden. \n\nThis seems like a case where profiling will reveal the culprit very quickly","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353889335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4354144038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116228#issuecomment-4354144038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116228","id":4354144038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA4b3Jg","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T16:14:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T16:23:40Z","body":"The culprit is re-spirv, I'm experimenting with serializing it to disk right now.\n\nThough I noticed another potential problem. When loading from cache, the operation is single threaded for all variants in a group. Whereas it spawns a group task when compiling the shaders. Maybe the cache load could be made multi threaded as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4354144038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]